# ============================================================
# MedCare — what never belongs in this repository
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# The site has no build step and no package.json, so most of what
# a .gitignore usually guards against does not exist here. What is
# left is the part that matters: secrets, and the machine-specific
# files that differ for every person who clones this.
#
# Note what is NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   js/supabase.js       holds the project URL and the anon public
#                        key, and is committed on purpose. That key
#                        identifies the project; it grants nothing.
#                        RLS is what protects the data.
#   .vscode/launch.json  the shared Chrome debug config the README
#                        points at. Only the personal files beside
#                        it are ignored.
# ============================================================

# ---------- Secrets ----------
# Nothing here reads a .env today. The entry exists so that the day
# someone adds one — for the Supabase CLI, for a deploy script, for
# anything — the service_role key inside it cannot be committed by
# reflex. That key bypasses every RLS policy on every table.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# ---------- Supabase CLI ----------
# Written by `supabase link` and `supabase start`. Local state and
# access tokens, not project source.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/config.toml

# ---------- Node ----------
# The one test needs `linkedom`, but the README has you install it
# into a scratch directory outside the repository. If you install it
# in here by mistake, this stops 40MB of it landing in a commit.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log

# ---------- Editor and tooling, per machine ----------
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/tasks.json
.vscode/*.local.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code: shared project settings can be committed, personal
# ones and local session state cannot.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/local/
.mcp.json

# ---------- OS clutter ----------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---------- Scratch ----------
*.log
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
tmp/
scratch/
